# title: Discount certificate
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: The stock bought at a discount, with the upside capped at 105%: long the stock, short a call.
#
# Notional 1000 of stock at the strike-date level; cap 105%. The discount
# is the price of the call sold, visible in the present value.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays 1000 * min(spot() / s0, 1.05)
